    "chunk_text": "sunan, scirewold & brihtwold. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t iohann h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht gunnilde \u00feurkilles dohter \u00e6t gode Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende, & he h\u00e6f\u00f0 hi bet\u00e6ht criste & sancte petre for his moder Her swutela\u00fe on \u00f0yssere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t s\u00e6wi hagg \u00e6t widecume h\u00e6f\u00fe gedon ut his twegen sunu \u00e6tt Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t lifgi\u00f0 \u00e6t forda is gefreod & hire twa cild for \u00feone biscop iohann Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gylm\u00e6r bohte s\u00e6\u00fery\u00fee \u00e6t s\u00e6wolde abbude mid III manxan, Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t wulwine hareberd bohte \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbude \u00e6lfgy\u00fee mid & crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gylsige bohte wynric \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbude mid anon yre golde. \u00deysses ys to gewitnysse \u00e6lfryd portgereua & eal se hired on ba\u00feon. Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende..",
